  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a clay pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion, garlic, and ginger, and saute until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the Scotch bonnet peppers, thyme, salt, and black pepper, and stir well.",
    "Add the chopped Chinese leaf and stir to combine.",
    "Pour in the soy sauce and stir to coat the leaves evenly.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional thyme if desired.",
    "Let it cool for a few minutes before serving."
